[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0029","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0847","title":"tinyproxy HTTP 代理服务器双重释放远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tinyproxy HTTP 代理服务器 1.5.0、1.4.3 及更早版本中存在双重释放（double-free）内存漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标代理服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，导致内存损坏，进而实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响运行 tinyproxy 的各类 Linux/Unix 系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0847"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 tinyproxy 至 1.4.4 或更高版本（上游修复版本）。Debian 用户应参考 DSA-145，将 woody 系统上的 tinyproxy 升级至 1.4.3-2woody2，unstable 系统升级至 1.4.3-3。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sourceforge.net/project/shownotes.php?release_id=88790","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9079.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4731","https://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-145"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0389","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0389.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0702","title":"ISC DHCPD 远程格式字符串漏洞","description":"ISC DHCPD（DHCP 守护进程）3.0 至 3.0.1rc8 版本中，动态 DNS 更新功能的日志记录模块（print.c）存在格式字符串漏洞。当启用 NSUPDATE 选项时，远程恶意 DNS 服务器可通过在 DNS 响应中注入特制格式字符串，触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。受影响的系统需升级至 ISC DHCPD 3.0.1rc9 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0702"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:58Z","remediation":"立即升级 ISC DHCPD 至 3.0.1rc9 或更高版本，该版本已修复 print.c 中动态 DNS 日志记录的格式字符串漏洞。各发行版用户请安装对应安全补丁：Caldera OpenLinux (CSSA-2002-028)、Mandrake Linux (MDKSA-2002-037)、SuSE Linux (SuSE-SA:2002:019)。如无法立即升级，可在 dhcpd.conf 中注释或移除 `ddns-update-style` 和 `ddns-updates` 相关配置以禁用 NSUPDATE 功能，并在防火墙层面限制 DHCPD 仅与受信任的 DNS 服务器通信作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0063.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000483","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102089498828206&w=2","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-12.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9039.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/854315","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-037.php","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_19_dhcp.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4701","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21440","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0702.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0702","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0702.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0702.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3e2d7833ca42f41a6bb2e84d7adeb5471252536d/2002/CVE-2002-0702.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0702.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0702.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0702.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0702.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0702.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0389.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0303","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0303.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0448","title":"Xerver Web Server HTTP请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Xerver Free Web Server 2.10 及更早版本在处理 HTTP 请求时存在输入验证漏洞。远程攻击者可以通过发送一个包含大量 \"C:/\" 序列的特制 HTTP 请求，触发服务器在解析路径时的处理异常，导致程序崩溃并引发拒绝服务（DoS）攻击。该漏洞无需身份验证即可触发，影响所有部署了相关版本的 Xerver 服务器，导致其无法响应正常请求。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0448"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:27Z","remediation":"将 Xerver Web Server 升级至 2.11 或更高版本以修复该拒绝服务漏洞，新版本已对包含大量 \"C:/\" 序列的 HTTP 请求进行过滤处理，防止服务器崩溃。如厂商未发布修复版本，建议迁移至 Apache、Nginx 等仍在维护的 Web 服务器。临时缓解措施可在前端部署反向代理或防火墙规则，拦截包含连续 \"C:/\" 字符串的异常请求，限制单条请求中特殊字符序列的最大重复次数，并确保 Web 服务器进程配置为崩溃后自动重启以维持服务可用性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-03/0091.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-03/0155.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8419.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4254","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21336","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2002/CVE-2002-0448.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d808dcfadcd0a0911218bbebd828dbae55c16a3e/2002/CVE-2002-0448.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0448.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0448.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0448.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/4d788f269ad44a501a2252f60eed87a3837ec472/2002/CVE-2002-0448/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0448.json","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/9508c0b3db6431c69ddd1cdc05f8039a387f817d/2002/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0448","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2002/CVE-2002-0448.json","https://github.com/alt3kx/CVE-2002-0448"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0303.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0303.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0303.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0301","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0301.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0440","title":"趋势科技 InterScan VirusWall Content-Length 扫描绕过漏洞","description":"Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall 3.5 和 3.6 版本的 HTTP 代理服务存在内容扫描绕过漏洞。当系统启用“若 Content-Length 为 0 则跳过扫描”选项时，恶意 Web 服务器可通过在 HTTP 响应头中设置 Content-Length 为 0，诱导代理服务器跳过安全扫描，而后续的 HTTP 客户端在处理时往往会忽略该头部并接收实际载荷。攻击者可利用此机制将恶意代码或病毒绕过防火墙检测传输至目标客户端，导致内部网络安全防御失效。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0440"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:27Z","remediation":"进入 InterScan VirusWall 配置界面，禁用“Skip scanning if Content-length equals 0”选项，强制所有 HTTP 请求经过扫描以防止绕过；建议升级至厂商发布的最新安全补丁版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/lists/bugtraq/2002/Mar/0162.html","http://www.inside-security.de/vwall_cl0.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8425.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4265","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21339","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2002/CVE-2002-0440.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0440.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0440.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0440.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0440.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0440","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0440.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0440.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0440.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0440.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0301.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0301.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0301.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0300","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0436","title":"Sun Solaris 7.0/8 Sunsolve CD SSCD_SunCourier.pl CGI 脚本任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Solaris 7.0/8 的 Sunsolve CD 软件包中的 sscd_suncourier.pl CGI 脚本存在命令注入漏洞。该漏洞的原理是脚本在处理 email address 参数时未能对输入进行严格过滤，导致远程攻击者可以通过在参数中构造 shell 元字符（如分号、反引号等）来注入恶意命令。攻击条件为目标系统部署了受影响的 CGI 脚本且可从网络访问。一旦利用成功，攻击者可以在目标服务器上执行任意系统命令，从而导致系统完全被接管，危害等级极高。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0436"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:26Z","remediation":"建议直接删除 Solaris 7.0/8 Sunsolve CD 中过时的 SSCD_SunCourier.pl CGI 脚本以消除风险。若必须保留，应修改脚本代码，对 email 参数使用正则表达式进行严格过滤，禁止包含 shell 元字符（如 ; | & ` $），或将调用 shell 的函数替换为不经过 shell 解析的 API。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8435.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/261544","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4269","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21340","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0436.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0436.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0436","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0436.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0436.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1e9aa0e87d4eb1e9f99e0f5b9c02665ba8ee98ef/2002/CVE-2002-0436.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0436.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0436.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0436.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0436.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0298","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0298.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0431","title":"XTux Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"XTux 游戏服务器在处理客户端初始连接请求时，未对输入数据进行有效性验证，攻击者可通过发送随机的垃圾数据触发异常处理逻辑，导致服务器 CPU 资源被大量消耗。该漏洞影响运行 XTux Server 2001.0 6.01 版本的服务器系统。利用条件为攻击者能够通过网络远程连接至目标服务器的 XTux 服务端口，且无需身份认证，仅需发送恶意连接数据即可触发消耗。攻击者通过向服务器发送特制的垃圾数据包，耗尽系统 CPU 资源，造成拒绝服务，使合法用户无法正常连接和使用服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0431"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:26Z","remediation":"停止使用已过时的 XTux Server 2001.0 6.01 版本，建议迁移至现代的安全服务器软件。若必须运行，请在网络防火墙上配置访问控制列表 (ACL)，限制仅允许受信任的 IP 地址访问该服务端口，以防止远程攻击者发送随机输入导致 CPU 耗尽。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/260912","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8422.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4260","https://sourceforge.net/tracker/index.php?func=detail&aid=529046&group_id=206&atid=100206","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21338","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0431.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0431.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0431","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0431.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0431.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1678061d20f9336914de78aef7c69168db2a7f8c/2002/CVE-2002-0431.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0431.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0431.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0431.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0431.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0298.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0291","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0291.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0406","title":"Menasoft SPHEREserver 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2002-0406是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0406"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:23Z","remediation":"升级至 SPHEREserver 最新稳定版本以修复该漏洞；在服务器防火墙或路由器上配置单 IP 最大并发连接数限制，阻止未认证的大量连接耗尽服务资源；在服务器前端部署负载均衡或反向代理，对客户端连接进行速率限制和验证后再转发至后端服务；在防火墙或网络层对 3128 端口实施访问控制，仅允许可信 IP 段连接；如短期内无法升级，可暂时停止对外提供 SPHEREserver 服务或迁移至受持续维护的现代替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/259334","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8338.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4258","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21337","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab00a662168d29727ed07327ed7248857f064d23/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0406.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e52b937328f58a3e9a1e7e8e4c1ac9025c3099d3/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0406.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0406","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0406.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0406.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d204edeccdebd5010352130572fc295de37005f2/2002/CVE-2002-0406.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0406.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/de5e978a48281a824409de119a9380c20aa11e39/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0406.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0406.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0406.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0291.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0291.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0291.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0232","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0232.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0704","title":"Linux NetFilter NAT 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Linux Netfilter 组件（iptables 1.2.6a 及更早版本）的网络地址转换功能在处理 ICMP 错误消息时，会错误地泄露经过地址转换后的内部真实 IP 地址。攻击者无需任何权限即可远程触发该漏洞（AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N），通过发送特制数据包诱导目标系统产生 ICMP 错误响应，从而在错误消息中获取内网真实 IP 信息，导致网络拓扑结构、主机布局等敏感信息泄露，严重破坏 NAT 提供的地址隐藏安全性。该漏洞影响启用 NAT 功能的 Linux 内核防火墙系统，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5（HIGH），机密性影响高（C:H），完整性和可用性无影响。NVD 于 2002-07-26 发布，建议升级至 iptables 1.2.6b 或内核 2.4.20 以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0704"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:58Z","remediation":"立即升级iptables到1.2.6b或以上版本，开启连接跟踪功能以完整记录NAT状态；在iptables规则中禁用自动生成的ICMP错误消息，实现IP地址信息过滤和隐藏；关闭不必要的日志记录功能，阻止通过防火墙规则间接泄露内网IP地址；如有条件，可迁移到nftables以获得更好的NAT状态跟踪和安全性","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102088521517722&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4116","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9043.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-030.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-086.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4699","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54d76ab772484c9516adea70c89afaeb5255051/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0704.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0704","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c0a11fc313619dcf9bfdd0db79ab9694b1de45d2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0704.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0704.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0704.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0704.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0704.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c5d5eae73f592ddf4dd88ea1c5b9789d879f4ac6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0704.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0704.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0704.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0232.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0205","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0205.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0435","title":"GNU File Utilities 竞争条件漏洞","description":"GNU File Utilities (fileutils) 4.1 及之前版本中存在竞争条件漏洞。当程序执行递归目录删除或移动操作时，本地攻击者可通过在删除过程中将低层级目录移动到更高层级，利用时间差触发竞态条件，导致 fileutils 的 chdir 跳转到预期之外的上级目录，最终可能指向根文件系统。成功利用此漏洞可使攻击者以运行 fileutils 的用户权限删除任意目录，影响系统文件完整性。攻击需要本地访问权限且利用条件较为苛刻，CVSS 评分 1.2，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0435"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:26Z","remediation":"升级到GNU fileutils 4.1以上版本，或迁移至GNU coreutils（fileutils的后继项目，已修复此问题）。Red Hat用户请安装RHSA-2003:015/RHSA-2003:016提供的更新包，Mandrake用户请安装MDKSA-2002:031更新，Caldera OpenLinux用户请安装CSSA-2002-018.1更新。在多用户共享系统上，避免对不可信目录结构执行递归删除或移动操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://mail.gnu.org/archive/html/bug-fileutils/2002-03/msg00028.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8432.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-031.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-015.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-016.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/260936","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4266","