llected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/274223","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-16.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/137115","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4837","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21484","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ab396be03b208767ce22804ad16877ccef3b54c/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0031.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0031","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/050a55b80525b99be98f5c84fe46fa8ac25be676/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0031.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0031.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/yahoo_installed.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h292-wpw4-4xhf/GHSA-h292-wpw4-4xhf.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0031.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0031.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148600_148700.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0146.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0122","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0122.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0014","title":"University of Washington Pine URL 处理远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Pine 4.43 及更早版本的 URL 处理代码存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含单引号包裹且含有 shell 元字符（如 &）的特制 URL 的邮件，当用户点击该 URL 时，Pine 会将其传递给 shell 执行，导致攻击者在用户系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响所有 Pine 4.43 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击无需身份认证，利用复杂度低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0014"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 Pine 至 4.44 或更高版本，该版本已修复 URL 处理中的命令注入漏洞。Red Hat 用户应安装 RHSA-2002:009 提供的更新包；HP-UX 用户应用 HPSBTL0201-015 补丁；Conectiva Linux 用户安装公告 000460 对应更新。临时缓解措施：在邮件客户端设置中禁用 Pine 的 URL 自动打开功能，或配置外部浏览器调用时对 URL 进行严格过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000460","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101027841605918&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-009.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3815","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBTL0201-015","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0014.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0014","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0014.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0014.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jmm6-4qwp-jx6x/GHSA-jmm6-4qwp-jx6x.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0014.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0014.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d963b83b-9aaa-4d56-b436-9667175dd9ef.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2008/freebsd_pine.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0122.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0020","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0715","title":"Squid Squid 代理认证凭证泄露漏洞","description":"Squid 2.4.STABLE6 之前版本存在代理认证凭证转发漏洞，当用户通过 Squid 代理访问远程 Web 站点时，代理服务器会在转发请求时错误地将用户的代理认证凭证（用户名和密码）转发给目标 Web 站点。远程攻击者可通过搭建恶意 Web 站点诱导代理用户访问，从而窃取用户的代理登录凭证。该漏洞影响 Squid 2.4.STABLE6 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等危害），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响机密性。攻击者只需诱导受害者通过易受攻击的 Squid 代理访问恶意站点即可窃取凭证。升级至 Squid 2.4.STABLE6 或更高版本可修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0715"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:59Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Squid 代理服务器至 2.4.STABLE6 或更高版本，升级前请备份配置文件 squid.conf。若暂时无法升级，请在 squid.conf 中配置 proxy_auth 代理认证时强制要求 HTTPS 连接，或在防火墙层面限制代理端口仅允许可信内网 IP 访问，禁止公网直接访问代理端口。升级后请重启 Squid 服务并验证代理认证功能正常。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102674543407606&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-051.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-130.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9478.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-044.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5154","http://www.squid-cache.org/Advisories/SQUID-2002_3.txt","http://www.squid-cache.org/Versions/v2/2.4/bugs/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0715.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0715","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0715.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0715.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0715.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0715.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0715.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0715.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c5d5eae73f592ddf4dd88ea1c5b9789d879f4ac6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0715.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0715.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0019","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0714","title":"Squid FTP 代理安全绕过漏洞","description":"该漏洞发生在 Squid 2.4.STABLE6 之前的 FTP 代理组件中，核心问题在于代理未能验证控制连接和数据连接的 IP 地址是否与实际 FTP 服务器一致。攻击者可通过向目标发起特制的 FTP 控制连接和数据连接，欺骗代理系统绕过防火墙验证机制，从而执行网络层面的伪装攻击。这意味着恶意用户无需认证即可执行网络隔离策略的破坏行为，例如通过改变数据通道的真实源地址来隐藏攻击来源，或伪造 FTP 服务器的响应以进行中间人攻击。该漏洞影响所有早于 2.4.STABLE6 版本的 Squid FTP 代理服务，攻击者可通过远程发送畸形 FTP 控制连接与数据连接的组合来触发该安全问题。目前市场上的众多旧版 Squid 产品均受到影响，建议用户尽快升级到安全版本以获取修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0714"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:59Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Squid 到 2.4.STABLE6 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面配置规则：仅允许 FTP 控制连接（21/tcp）与数据连接（20/tcp 或被动模式端口范围）源自同一 FTP 服务器 IP，并拒绝源 IP 不一致的 FTP 数据连接，作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快通过包管理器（如 apt upgrade squid、yum update squid）或从官网 http://www.squid-cache.org/Versions/v2/2.4/ 下载 2.4.STABLE6 及以上版本编译安装，升级后重启 squid 服务使补丁生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000506","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102674543407606&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-051.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-130.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9479.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-044.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5924","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5158","http://www.squid-cache.org/Advisories/SQUID-2002_3.txt","http://www.squid-cache.org/Versions/v2/2.4/bugs/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0714.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0714","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0714.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0714.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0714.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0714.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0714.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c5d5eae73f592ddf4dd88ea1c5b9789d879f4ac6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0714.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0714.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0714.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0018","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0713","title":"Squid 代理服务器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Squid 2.4.STABLE6 之前版本存在多个缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过三种攻击向量触发：(1) MSNT 认证助手在使用 denyusers 或 allowusers 文件时；(2) Gopher 客户端处理；(3) FTP 服务器目录列表解析器生成 HTML 输出时。成功利用可导致服务拒绝（进程崩溃）甚至远程任意代码执行，影响 Squid 2.4.STABLE6 之前所有版本，CVSS 7.5 高危，攻击无需认证且可远程利用。官方已在 2.4.STABLE6 版本修复，建议升级修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0713"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:59Z","remediation":"tags.<value>建议立即升级 Squid 到 2.4.STABLE6 或更高版本（可从官网 http://www.squid-cache.org/ 下载）。若暂时无法升级，可通过以下配置缓解：1) 禁用 MSNT 认证助手（注释掉 squid.conf 中 auth_param ntlm program 相关行）；2) 禁用 Gopher 支持（在 squid.conf 中设置 gopher_enabled off）；3) 禁用 FTP 目录列表的 HTML 输出（设置 ftp_list_width 0 或注释 ftp 相关配置）。同时在防火墙层面限制仅信任 IP 访问 Squid 代理端口（默认 3128）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102674543407606&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-051.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-130.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9480.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9481.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9482.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-044.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5155","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5156","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5157","http://www.squid-cache.org/Advisories/SQUID-2002_3.txt","http://www.squid-cache.org/Versions/v2/2.4/bugs/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54d76ab772484c9516adea70c89afaeb5255051/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0713.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0713","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c0a11fc313619dcf9bfdd0db79ab9694b1de45d2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0713.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0713.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0713.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0713.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0713.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c5d5eae73f592ddf4dd88ea1c5b9789d879f4ac6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0713.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0713.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0713.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0018.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0018.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0017","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0703","title":"Gisle Aas MD5模块 UTF-8摘要计算漏洞","description":"Perl 的 Digest::MD5 模块（perl-Digest-MD5）与 Perl 解释器之间存在交互缺陷，导致处理 UTF-8 编码数据时生成错误的 MD5 校验和。攻击者可利用此缺陷构造经过篡改的 UTF-8 数据，使其通过错误的 MD5 校验从而绕过完整性验证机制。该漏洞影响所有使用 perl-Digest-MD5 模块进行数据完整性校验的 Perl 应用程序与系统，包括基于 Perl 的软件包管理系统和文件校验工具。攻击者无需身份认证即可在网络路径上发送特制的 UTF-8 数据，触发错误的校验和计算，进而实施数据篡改攻击。CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危。Red Hat、Mandriva 等发行版已通过安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0703"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:58Z","remediation":"升级 perl-Digest-MD5 模块至修复版本，或更新操作系统至包含安全补丁的版本。Red Hat 用户应参照 RHSA-2002-081 升级受影响的 Perl 包，Mandriva 用户应参照 MDKSA-2002-035 更新 perl-Digest-MD5。在无法立即升级的情况下，可临时禁用依赖 MD5 校验和验证的 Perl 应用服务，或使用其他哈希算法替代 MD5 进行数据完整性校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-081.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9051.php